# Second line of defence for `vercel deploy` from this machine, which does NOT
# read .gitignore. Anything listed here is never uploaded to Vercel, so it can
# never be served from the CDN.

# The product. Selling it requires that it is not sitting at a public URL.
uploads/
*.pdf

# Master images — source PNGs for `assets/*.webp`. Only the WebP output ships.
local-source/

.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules/
.vercel/
.thumbnail
supabase/
scripts/
README.md
TESTING.md
